  <name>Ectolens</name>
  <summary>Take screenshots and recordings</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Ectolens takes screenshots and screen recordings from one overlay: press Print Screen, frame a region, a window or a whole screen, then copy, save or record it. Recordings use quality settings you choose, at frame rates up to your screen's own, and are written so that a crash cannot ruin the file.
    </p>
    <p>
      Ectolens is based on KDE Spectacle.
    </p>
  </description>
